ie</surname><given-names>MH</given-names></name><name><surname>Stehle</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>de Bree</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Snow</surname><given-names>GB</given-names></name><name><surname>Oyen</surname><given-names>WJ</given-names></name><name><surname>van Dongen</surname><given-names>GA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Phase I therapy study with (186)Re-labeled humanized monoclonal antibody BIWA 4 (bivatuzumab) in patients with head and neck squamous cell carcinoma</article-title><source>Clin. Cancer Res</source><year>2003</year><volume>9</volume><fpage>3961S</fpage><lpage>3972S</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14506195</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R100"><label>100</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jain</surname><given-names>RK</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Delivery of molecular and cellular medicine to solid tumors</article-title><source>J. Control Release</source><year>1998</year><volume>53</volume><fpage>49</fpage><lpage>67</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9741913</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R101"><label>101</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Carmeliet</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Angiogenesis in life, disease and medicine</article-title><source>Nature</source><year>2005</year><volume>438</volume><fpage>932</fpage><lpage>936</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16355210</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="R102"><label>102</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Berndorff</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Borkowski</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Moosmayer</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Viti</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surn